* Test git gq pop /push with NULL parent
----------------------------------------

$ ls
README.txt
script.sh

$ git status --porcelain
?? .gqpatches/

$ git gq applied
abcdef0 script.sh was improved.
abcdef0 README was improved.

$ git gq unapplied

Set parent to 'NULL'.
$ git gq parent NULL

$ git gq applied
abcdef0 script.sh was improved.
abcdef0 README was improved.
abcdef0 initial commit

$ git gq unapplied

Now unapply all patches.
$ git gq pop -a
HEAD is now at abcdef0 README was improved.
HEAD is now at abcdef0 initial commit
rm '.gitignore'
rm 'README.txt'
rm 'script.sh'
[master abcdef0] NULL

$ git gq applied
abcdef0 NULL

$ git gq unapplied
initial-commit.patch
README-was-improved.patch
script.sh-was-improved.patch

$ ls

$ git status --porcelain
?? .gqpatches/

Now apply all patches.
$ git gq push -a
Checking patch .gitignore...
Checking patch README.txt...
Checking patch script.sh...
